The socket macro interface is identical to the WLAN (ESP32) component so the Network Comms, Web Server, MQTT and other network layers work unchanged on top of it.' category='Comms: Networking' category2='' category3='' bIs2dOnly='1' bIs3dOnly='0' catenable='1' author='Matrix Ltd.' manuname='Espressif' manucode='' sysinfo='1061147' keywords='' dynamic='1' scadaCompatible='0' embeddedCompatible='1' showmacros='1' iconpath='..\..\Icons\Components\TCP_IP.png' />
